findings.remediation:
Add two files to the module root, mirroring terraform-gcp-pubsub's google_project_service_identity.pubsub.tf / google_kms_crypto_key_iam_member.pubsub_service_agent.tf pattern:

# google_project_service_identity.documentai.tf
resource "google_project_service_identity" "documentai" {
  provider = google-beta
  service  = "documentai.googleapis.com"
}

# google_kms_crypto_key_iam_member.documentai_service_agent.tf
resource "google_kms_crypto_key_iam_member" "documentai_service_agent" {
  crypto_key_id = var.kms_key_name
  role          = "roles/cloudkms.cryptoKeyEncrypterDecrypter"
  member        = "serviceAccount:${google_project_service_identity.documentai.email}"
}

Also add a google-beta entry to example/examplea/terraform.tf's required_providers block (matching pubsub's example), since the module now references provider = google-beta.

